Cell["\<\
Refine the display of indeterminate singularities in the sector graph. Non \
repeating letters are marked in orange and are displayed on a node. This is \
to indicate that, once a discontinuity has been taken with respect to that \
variable, one is forced to leave that sector and move down the graph.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1250265471,ExpressionUUID->"c864d136-502f-4cdc-8aee-b81ebdc826f2"],

